     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks so much for the reply Clayton, I appreciate the insight.<div><br></div><div>I think your first point is well taken, and where my thought process is at as well. </div><div><br></div><div>As far as scaling covariates, I stumbled with that issue a little while ago as well but got it fixed as I suspected that was causing me some problems too.</div><div><br></div><div>Anyways, thanks again for the response, it was very helpful.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Rory</div></div>"
